WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.959
The next day Robot heard the dog barking downstairs.

2
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.669
Yip! Yip! Yip!

3
00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.788
"Ugh," Robot thought.

4
00:00:11.789 --> 00:00:15.344
"Julia's dog never stops barking."

5
00:00:15.345 --> 00:00:20.297
Then Robot heard a different sound. Grr-owl.

6
00:00:20.298 --> 00:00:23.230
It seemed to come from the hallway.

7
00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:26.426
"What is that noise?" Robot thought.

8
00:00:26.427 --> 00:00:29.418
It grew louder.

9
00:00:29.419 --> 00:00:37.925
"I'll be brave and check it out," Robot thought.

10
00:00:37.926 --> 00:00:45.532
Slowly he went into the hallway.

11
00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:48.409
There was Noly and . . .

12
00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:51.478
Julia's dog was chasing her!

13
00:00:51.479 --> 00:00:55.820
The little dog had a sparkly collar.

14
00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:59.572
It barked and snarled.

15
00:00:59.573 --> 00:01:04.464
Growl! The dog tried to bite Noly's tail.

16
00:01:04.465 --> 00:01:07.175
It pawed at her face.

17
00:01:07.176 --> 00:01:12.883
"Ahh!" Noly shouted. "Help! Help!"

18
00:01:12.884 --> 00:01:16.126
The dog backed her against the wall.

19
00:01:16.127 --> 00:01:20.651
It barked furiously. Yip! Yip! Yip!

20
00:01:20.652 --> 00:01:26.301
"Time for some superhero action!" Robot thought.

21
00:01:26.302 --> 00:01:29.159
He went closer.

22
00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:31.976
He tried not to be afraid. Robot

23
00:01:31.977 --> 00:01:35.823
clicked his claw and flashed his lights. He

24
00:01:35.824 --> 00:01:39.707
beeped as loudly as he could. Beep! Beep! The

25
00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:41.653
dog spun around. Robot

26
00:01:41.654 --> 00:01:45.602
did it again. Beep! Beep! The

27
00:01:45.603 --> 00:01:48.740
dog didn't like Robot's loud noises. The

28
00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:53.005
dog growled softly. Growl! Robot

29
00:01:53.006 --> 00:01:54.845
went closer. He

30
00:01:54.846 --> 00:01:57.338
kept flashing and beeping. The

31
00:01:57.339 --> 00:01:59.800
dog's growls got louder. Robot

32
00:01:59.801 --> 00:02:02.908
swung his arm and— bop!

33
00:02:02.909 --> 00:02:05.990
He bopped the dog's nose with his claw.

34
00:02:05.991 --> 00:02:11.744
Owwl! The dog howled and ran away.

35
00:02:11.745 --> 00:02:17.232
Robot let out a breath. "Whew!"

36
00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:21.259
"You saved me!" Noly said.

37
00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:26.777
"Thanks, Robot. You're a hero!"

38
00:02:26.778 --> 00:02:29.768
Robot nodded proudly.

39
00:02:29.769 --> 00:02:32.954
"I did it," Robot thought.

40
00:02:32.955 --> 00:02:36.906
"I was brave and saved the day."

41
00:02:36.907 --> 00:02:40.678
Maybe he could become like MechaTron on his own.

42
00:02:40.679 --> 00:02:46.180
Maybe he didn't need that fairy's help!

